    "created_at": "2016-06-21T12:44:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-21T12:44:04Z",
    "body": "We have a handle on the property descriptor. To accomplish what you want it seems we need a handle on the underlying object's implementation of the feature being accessed, no? (Or indeed use vague language, but we just got rid of that...)\n",
